1
00:00:12,288 --> 00:00:19,196
Cette abbaye, datant du douzième siècle, fait actuellement l'objet d'une restauration.
This abbey, dating from the twelfth century, is currently being restored.

2
00:00:19,296 --> 00:00:26,588
Elle a été classée monument historique en mille neuf cent trente. Il convient de la préserver.
It was listed as a historic monument in 1930. It should be preserved.

3
00:00:26,688 --> 00:00:33,452
Il importe que les travaux respectent l'architecture d'origine, sans qu'on dénature le lieu.
It's important that the work respects the original architecture, without the place being distorted.

4
00:00:33,552 --> 00:00:41,276
Les fonds publics ne suffisent pas toujours. Des associations participent aussi à la collecte.
Public funds are not always enough. Associations also take part in fundraising.

5
00:00:41,376 --> 00:00:47,252
Le patrimoine, c'est ce que nous transmettons aux générations futures.
Heritage is what we pass on to future generations.

6
00:00:47,352 --> 00:00:55,052
Bien qu'il coûte cher, il donne une identité à nos villes. Ce serait dommage de le perdre.
Although it's expensive, it gives our towns an identity. It would be a pity to lose it.
